cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evidence, cite the versioned technical report under preferred-citation."
title: "Source-Overlap-Controlled Human Activity Classification"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-24
authors:
  - family-names: Huseyinli
    given-names: Abdulla
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdullahuseyinli-dot/human-activity-classification"
url: "https://github.com/abdullahuseyinli-dot/human-activity-classification"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A leakage-audited human activity classification study spanning the four-class
  POLAR benchmark and a locked person-level V-COCO follow-up. The release includes
  source-overlap controls, DINOv2 and ConvNeXt experiments, scale-conditioned views,
  factorized targets, calibrated classifiers, paired uncertainty, attribution
  diagnostics, and bounded fault injection.
keywords:
  - human activity recognition
  - transfer learning
  - DINOv2
  - ConvNeXt
  - V-COCO
  - domain adaptation
  - calibration
  - evaluation methodology
